  "_note": "Questions written by reading each public sample report before running the engine. Files are third-party samples published on GitHub (see sources); they are downloaded by evaluation/field/fetch.mjs into a local, git-ignored folder and never committed. expect = regex the on-screen lead must match; null = the record cannot answer (a right answer is no lead, or NOT_IN_REPORT).",
